msgid "Manage the Perfmatters settings estate from Minn's Performance surface. Download the paid plugin .zip from Perfmatters."
msgstr "Beheer de Perfmatters-instellingen vanuit Minn's Performance-oppervlak. Download de betaalde plug-in .zip van Perfmatters."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9715
msgid "Bring ACF PRO repeaters, flexible content, galleries, options pages, blocks, and field groups into Minn. Download the plugin .zip from ACF."
msgstr "Breng ACF PRO-repeaters, flexibele inhoud, galerijen, optiepagina's, blokken en veldgroepen naar Minn. Download de plug-in .zip van ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9727
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
msgstr "Beheer Elementor-formulierinzendingen in Minn terwijl de pagina-inhoud van Elementor wordt beschermd. Download de plug-in .zip van Elementor."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9739
